msgid "Pending approval, approved, and pending cancellation requests are included."
msgstr "A jóváhagyásra vagy visszavonásra váró és a jóváhagyott igényeket is tartalmazza."

msgid "Basic leave, supplementary leaves, parental leave, paternity leave, and leave carry-over."
